    "print(\"✅ AudioCraft instalado correctamente\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🔌 CELDA 2 — Verificar GPU\n",
    "\n",
    "Confirmamos que Colab nos asignó una GPU.  \n",
    "Si dice `NVIDIA Tesla T4` (o similar), estamos listos."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Verificar GPU disponible ─────────────────────────────────────────\n",
